{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t國家主席習近平在深圳，會見出席亞太經合組織領導人非正式會議的俄羅斯總統普京，形容中俄關係「風雨不動安如山」，為變亂交織的世界提供更多穩定性和確定性。<br/>\n<br/>\n他又說，要深化兩國全方位合作，引領和推動世界多極化和國際關係民主化。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：王濱南\t\t</p>\n<ul><li>主頁</li></ul></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T01:24:01.031602+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 大中華","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T12:07:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T04:37:33.769386+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T01:17:42.659366+00:00","content_hash":"9133095f0728f7ed3e9fbad95ec82c5ea2e3dd2ce313e801cdaca0f41d443c48","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}